{"id": 26780, "group": "campus-iiit-bangalore-placements", "sent_at": "2026-11-12T13:37:35.109471+00:00", "text": "from 4 shared experiences, Dell interviews are mostly 3 to 4 rounds.\n\n• technical round: DSA (arrays, trees, linked list, DP, graphs, binary search) + OOPS + DBMS/SQL + OS + CN + project discussion\n• one experience had OA with 2 DSA problems + CS MCQs before interviews\n• final round is HR, standard behavioral questions only\n\nGave this OA recently? Do reply and correct me, helpful reply gets the coins on this question 🪙\nMore experiences here: https://oahelper.in/interview-experiences", "author_tag": null, "reply_to": {"id": 26732, "text": "Dell interview anyone", "author_tag": "ISM"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
